      <description>PRINCETON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Intelligent AF launched today as an AI-fluency ecosystem that brings education, community, events, career services, media and investment into one membership for the legal industry. The company will start in legal and expand into other professional services industries. It is backed by a group of investors led by Mike Dalewitz of Greenwood Drive Investments, who will serve as executive chairman. Co-founder Cat Casey, a legal AI executive and influencer who helped</description>
